  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:422px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-gold pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Voice Thievery</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/8/8a/RymTWGw.gif/revision/latest?cb=20141024214458\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"RymTWGw\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/8/8a/RymTWGw.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20141024214458\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/8/8a/RymTWGw.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20141024214458 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/8/8a/RymTWGw.gif/revision/latest?cb=20141024214458 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"RymTWGw\" width=\"270\" height=\"150\" data-image-key=\"RymTWGw.gif\" data-image-name=\"RymTWGw.gif\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Ursula (The Little Mermaid) stealing Ariel's voice.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Steal voices from others.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>steal the voices of others</b>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Objects\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Objects</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FVoice_Thievery%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Voice Absorption/Stealing/Theft</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FVoice_Thievery%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb and steal the voices of others, taking away targets' ability to make even the slightest vocal noise, and use the target's voice for themselves.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FVoice_Thievery%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Muting\" title=\"Muting\">Muting</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Vocal_Mimicry\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vocal Mimicry\">Vocal Mimicry</a></li>\n<li>Stealing the vocal abilities of others, including:\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Death_Song\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Death Song\">Death Song</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Empathic_Voice\" title=\"Empathic Voice\">Empathic Voice</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Holy_Voice\" title=\"Holy Voice\">Holy Voice</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Omnitone\" title=\"Omnitone\">Omnitone</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Persuasion\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Persuasion\">Persuasion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Singing_Creation\" title=\"Singing Creation\">Singing Creation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Siren_Song\" title=\"Siren Song\">Siren Song</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Sonic_Scream\" title=\"Sonic Scream\">Sonic Scream</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Casting\" title=\"Spell Casting\">Spell Casting</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Subliminal_Messaging\" title=\"Subliminal Messaging\">Subliminal Messaging</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Subliminal_Seduction\" title=\"Subliminal Seduction\">Subliminal Seduction</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Voice\" title=\"Supernatural Voice\">Supernatural Voice</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ventriloquism_Mastery\" title=\"Ventriloquism Mastery\">Ventriloquism Mastery</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Verbal_Teleportation\" title=\"Verbal Teleportation\">Verbal Teleportation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Vocal_Creation\" title=\"Vocal Creation\">Vocal Creation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Vocal_Replication\" title=\"Vocal Replication\">Vocal Replication</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Vocifery\" title=\"Vocifery\">Vocifery</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Word_Manifestation\" title=\"Word Manifestation\">Word Manifestation</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FVoice_Thievery%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Sound_Absorption\" title=\"Sound Absorption\">Sound Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Voice_Projection\" title=\"Voice Projection\">Voice Projection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Voice_Switching\" title=\"Voice Switching\">Voice Switching</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FVoice_Thievery%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Cannot affect the users of <a href=\"/wiki/Supreme_Voice\" title=\"Supreme Voice\">Supreme Voice</a></li>\n<li>only steals spoken language, a character may still communicate via sign language or non-verbal means (likewise has no effect on written language).</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FVoice_Thievery%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"scrollable\" style=\"overflow:auto; max-height:275px; width:100%; -moz-border-radius-topleft:0.5em; border:1px solid #AAAAAA; padding-left:0.5em; background:transparent;\">\n<ul><li>Voice Box (<i>Batwheels</i>); singing voices only</li>\n<li>Verde (<i>Dog Days</i>)</li>\n<li>The Sea Witch (<i>The Little Mermaid</i>)</li>\n<li>Ursula (<i>Disney's The Little Mermaid</i>)</li>\n<li>Pylon Spiders (<i>Skyscraper Throne</i>)</li>\n<li>The Voice Card (<i>Cardcaptor Sakura</i>)</li>\n<li>Voicia (<i>Merc Storia</i>)</li>\n<li>Mr. Gorf (<i>Wayside School Gets a Little Stranger</i>)</li>\n<li>Poseidon (<i>Once Upon a Time</i>)</li>\n<li>Regina Mills/The Evil Queen (<i>Once Upon a Time</i>)</li>\n<li>Entoma Vasilissa Zeta (<i>Overlord</i>)</li>\n<li>The Midnight Entity (<i>Doctor Who</i>)</li>\n<li>Mr. Alchemy (<i>Teamo Supremo</i>)</li>\n<li>Jazz Hands (<i>Totally Spies</i>), via his accordion</li>\n<li>Jinx (<i>Teen Titans Go!</i>); (from jinxed people who break the jinx)</li>\n<li>Viren (<i>The Dragon Prince</i>)</li>\n<li>Luka Couffaine/Silencer (<i>Miraculous: Tales of Ladybug &amp; Cat Noir</i>)</li>\n<li>Val Santiago (<i>Lost Girl</i>)</li>\n<li>Rumpelstiltskin (<i>Winx Club</i>)</li>\n<li>Praxina And Mephisto(<i>Lolirock</i>): In the episode \"Sing For Me\". They only take the singing voices of people but not their speaking voices.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Objects\">Known Objects</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FVoice_Thievery%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Poseidon's Enchanted Shell (<i>Once Upon a Time</i>); only someone's ability to sing</li>\n<li>Ursula's Nautilus Shell(<i>The Little Mermaid</i>)</li>\n<li>Gentlemen's Box (<i>Buffy, the Vampire Slayer</i>)</li>\n<li>The Monkey Totem (<i>Charmed</i>)</li>\n<li>Dummystein Magisword (<i>Mighty Magiswords</i>)</li>\n<li>Voice-stealing box (<i>60s Batman TV series</i>)</li>\n<li>Jazz Hands' Accordion (<i>Totally Spies</i>)</li>\n<li>Pearls of Night Voices (<i>Doctor Ramune Mysterious Disease Specialist</i>). These mysterious objects can be used only by a man and a woman who love each other (which includes types of love other than romantic) to communicate across distance, similarly to a cellphone. After each usage, the pearl takes a part of the user's voice, making it quieter each time, until it disappears completely.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"